Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.34,Leg,,0,0,0,,Na aula de hoje
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.34,0:00:01.14,Leg,,0,0,0,,você vai aprender
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.14,0:00:02.20,Leg,,0,0,0,,a fazer o rest-pause.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.20,0:00:03.45,Leg,,0,0,0,,Como fazemos o rest-pause?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.50,0:00:04.42,Leg,,0,0,0,,Coloque o peso normal
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.42,0:00:05.26,Leg,,0,0,0,,que você faz,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.26,0:00:06.25,Leg,,0,0,0,,o máximo que você aguenta.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.30,0:00:06.81,Leg,,0,0,0,,Vamos supor que eu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.81,0:00:08.45,Leg,,0,0,0,,aguente 40 quilos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.50,0:00:09.40,Leg,,0,0,0,,Coloquei 40,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.43,0:00:10.90,Leg,,0,0,0,,vou fazer 10 repetições.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.57,0:00:21.05,Leg,,0,0,0,,Fiz as 10,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.05,0:00:22.70,Leg,,0,0,0,,eu vou descansar 10 segundos,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.70,0:00:23.90,Leg,,0,0,0,,sem tirar o pé da parede.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.17,0:00:27.88,Leg,,0,0,0,,Deu os 10 segundos,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.88,0:00:29.05,Leg,,0,0,0,,você vai fazer novamente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.05,0:00:29.88,Leg,,0,0,0,,a máxima quantidade
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.88,0:00:30.90,Leg,,0,0,0,,que você conseguir.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.09,0:00:40.92,Leg,,0,0,0,,Isso conta uma série
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.92,0:00:41.97,Leg,,0,0,0,,de rest-pause.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.97,0:00:42.81,Leg,,0,0,0,,Ou seja, se na sua ficha
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.81,0:00:43.48,Leg,,0,0,0,,tiver escrito
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.48,0:00:45.03,Leg,,0,0,0,,3 séries de rest-pause,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.03,0:00:46.04,Leg,,0,0,0,,você vai fazer 10,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.04,0:00:47.04,Leg,,0,0,0,,descansar 10 segundos
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.04,0:00:48.15,Leg,,0,0,0,,e fazer mais 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:49.01,Leg,,0,0,0,,Aí você vai descansar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.01,0:00:49.75,Leg,,0,0,0,,1 minuto
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.75,0:00:50.47,Leg,,0,0,0,,e vai repetir esse ciclo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.47,0:00:51.83,Leg,,0,0,0,,por 2 vezes.
